{
  "name": "VeyCall: Mattermost",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "291e55a9-de52-5747-85c9-ae8f4bd7c112",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## VeyCall: Mattermost\n\nYour VeyCall agent answers messages in a Mattermost channel, **as a threaded reply**, with no Mattermost credential: it uses an outgoing webhook.\n\n1. In Mattermost: *Integrations › Outgoing Webhooks › Add*. Content type `application/json`, pick the channel (and trigger words if you want), callback URL: this workflow's **production URL** (Webhook node).\n2. **VeyCall node**: create a *VeyCall API* credential with your organization API key (`vc_live_…`, VeyCall dashboard; needs the *API and webhooks* activation), then pick your agent.\n3. Activate.\n\nThe webhook's own replies don't trigger it again.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 420,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bd10a050-89e8-5dc3-a142-db9515b192cf",
      "name": "Mattermost message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "veycall-mattermost",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "webhookId": "veycall-mattermost"
    },
    {
      "id": "205ff145-43fc-50f0-b351-7991a9f971fe",
      "name": "VeyCall answers",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-veycall.veyCall",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "answer",
        "agentId": "",
        "channel": "mattermost",
        "conversationId": "={{ $json.body.channel_id }}",
        "messageId": "={{ $json.body.post_id }}",
        "senderId": "={{ $json.body.user_id }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.body.text }}",
        "audioSource": "none",
        "replyAs": "text",
        "additionalFields": {
          "senderName": "={{ $json.body.user_name }}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0db14161-f4ea-533b-a963-35b5b7449b33",
      "name": "Reply in thread",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.reply?.text ? { text: $json.reply.text, response_type: 'comment' } : {}) }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Mattermost message": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "VeyCall answers",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "VeyCall answers": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Reply in thread",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
    "description": "Your VeyCall AI agent answers Mattermost messages as threaded replies, through an outgoing webhook."
  },
  "pinData": {}
}
